.TH DDN-UP "1" "2026\-11\-19" "ddnetmirror 0.0.1" "ddnetmirror manual"
.SH NAME
ddn up \- fetch, fix up, generate and deploy the lab described by ddnetmirror.yml
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ddn
up [-h]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Build and deploy the lab described by ./ddnetmirror.yml: refuse if the lab already has containers, collect configs and LLDP from CloudVision, apply fixup rules, regenerate the project's files (as ddn fetch \-\-force), and only if that completed, run 'containerlab deploy' (through sudo unless containerlab runs as you). ddnetmirror.yml keys: server, name, tag (KEY=VALUE); optional cacert, fixup\-rules (a path or none), image. The token is read as for ddn fetch.

.SH DISTRIBUTION
The latest version of ddnetmirror may be downloaded from
.UR https://github.com/DaphnisDuck/ddnetmirror
.UE
